  "prefLabel": "We 300 LICENSE REQUIREMENTS, QUALIFICATIONS, FEES, AND APPLICATION PROCEDURES",
  "recordType": "rule-chapter",
  "ruleText": "CHAPTER We 300 LICENSE REQUIREMENTS, QUALIFICATIONS, FEES, AND APPLICATION PROCEDURES\n\nREVISION NOTE:\n\nDocument #12083, effective 3-1-17, readopted with amendments Chapters We 300 through We 900. Document #12083 replaces all prior filings for rules in the former Chapters We 300 through We 900.\n\nThe amendments in Document #12083 included extensive internal renumbering within Chapter We 300 and Chapter We 600. The prior filings for the former Chapter We 300 include the following documents:\n\n#2557, eff 12-27-83\n\n#4418, eff 5-2-88\n\n#4550, eff 1-1-89\n\n#4730, eff 1-15-90\n\n#4898, eff 8-13-90, EXPIRED 8-13-96\n\n#6327, INTERIM, eff 8-24-96, EXPIRED 12-22-96\n\n#6449, eff 1-29-97\n\n#7307, eff 6-13-00\n\n#9179, eff 6-13-08\n\nThe rules in the former Chapters We 300 through We 900 which had last been filed under Document #9179 did not expire on 6-13-16 since they were extended pursuant to RSA 541-A:14-a until replaced by the rules in Document #12083, effective 3-1-17.",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/we100-1000.html"
